TEXT 96 48 Left 3 ;#406 Sawtooth relaxation oscillator
TEXT 96 112 Left 2 ;Source: Alan Wolke (W2AEW), https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VXZH3UE-kSw
TEXT 96 160 Left 2 ;The current regulator diode charges 0.1uF, and an inverted, open-base 2N3904 dumps the charge once it breaks down.
TEXT 96 576 Left 2 ;XAVAL is a behavioural snapback switch, not a 2N3904 model. Its thresholds are set to the 7.25 V
TEXT 96 608 Left 2 ;and 4.35 V levels Alan's sawtooth reaches on screen, and its 150 ohm on-resistance to the fall he
TEXT 96 640 Left 2 ;shows. The resulting oscillation frequency is an output of the model, not a fitted value.
TEXT 96 696 Left 2 !.tran 0 5m 0 1u uic
TEXT 96 736 Left 2 !.options plotwinsize=0
